+    Scoped by memory_id AND root_memory_id AND tenant_id so a node that
+    happens to share an id across maps (it cannot, per the membership PK,
+    but defence in depth) or a different tenant can never be touched. The
+    migration 0044 CHECK constraints enforce the open/resolved/dropped
+    consistency rules structurally — this function trusts them.
